      "question": "What are the access hours for the Riverside workshop and on which days is it closed?",
      "kind": "answerable",
      "expected_status": "answered",
      "facts": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "c4f0ce4a0755cc50",
          "quote": "The Riverside workshop opens Monday to Friday from 09:00 to 20:00. It opens Saturday from 10:00 to 16:00. The workshop is closed on Sunday."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What induction requirements must adult members complete before using the laser cutter?",
      "kind": "answerable",
      "expected_status": "answered",
      "facts": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "c4f0ce4a0755cc50",
          "quote": "Every member must complete the general induction before entering a work area. General induction lasts 45 minutes and is booked through the member portal. Completing general induction does not authorize use of the laser cutter. Laser cutter access requires a separate laser induction and a current equipment endorsement. An endorsement expires 12 months after the induction date. A member with an expired endorsement must attend a refresher before booking that equipment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What happens if a member cancels a booking less than 24 hours before the session start?",
      "kind": "answerable",
      "expected_status": "answered",
      "facts": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "422f893883c7d8a5",
          "quote": "Cancellations less than 24 hours before the session start receive no refund."
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "04c1d2d7f2fe6924",
